{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]The heavens are yours, and [F/A]yours the earth
[Gm]You founded the world and all [F]that fills [Eb]it
[Bb]North and south you creat[F/A]ed by your [Gm]word
Tabor and Hermon [F]sing for [Eb]joy at your [F]name
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb]Yours is an arm of pow[F]er and might
[Gm]Your hand is strong, your right [Dm]hand lifted [Eb]high
Righteousness and [F]justice hold your [Gm]throne
Love and [F/A]faithfulness [Eb]go before you
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Blessed are the people who [F]know the festal [Gm]shout
Who walk, [Eb]LORD, in the light of your [Bb]face
They rejoice in [F]your name all day [Gm]long
In your [Eb]righteousness they are lifted [Bb]up
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
For you are the glo[F/A]ry of their [Gm]strength
By your favor you [F]raise our horn [Eb]high
[Bb]Our shield be[F/A]longs to the LORD a[Gm]lone
Our king to the Holy [F]One of [Eb]Is[F]rael
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Eb]Love and faithful[F]ness walk ahead of [Gm]us
Light upon our [Dm]path, day and [Eb]night
We lift our voic[F]es in holy [Gm]praise
To [F/A]the Holy One [Eb]of Is[Bb]rael
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Blessed are the people [F]who know the fes[Gm]tal shout
Who [Eb]walk, LORD, in the light of [Bb]your face
They rejoice [F]in your name [Gm]all day long
[Eb]In your righteousness they are [Bb]lifted up
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
Walk [Eb]in your [Gm]light, [F]O Lord
Walk in your [Eb][Gm]light
{end_of_verse}

